{"id":"7-1-3","courseId":"7","chapterNumber":"1.3","title":"Multiplikasjon og divisjon med brøk","description":"Gange og dele brøker.","estimatedMinutes":45,"exercises":[],"competenceGoals":["utvikle og bruke metodar for hovudrekning, overslagsrekning og skriftleg rekning med heile tal, desimaltal, brøkar og prosent"],"content":[{"id":"7-1-3-intro","type":"text","content":"## Multiplikasjon av brøker\n\nÅ gange brøker er enklere enn å legge dem sammen! Vi ganger bare teller med teller og nevner med nevner."},{"id":"7-1-3-mult-regel","type":"definition","title":"Multiplikasjon av brøker","content":"$$\\frac{a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{a \\cdot c}{b \\cdot d}$$\n\n**Eksempel:**\n$$\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{4}{5} = \\frac{2 \\cdot 4}{3 \\cdot 5} = \\frac{8}{15}$$"},{"id":"7-1-3-example-1","type":"example","title":"Eksempel 1: Gange brøker","problem":"Regn ut: $\\frac{3}{4} \\cdot \\frac{2}{5}$","solution":"**Løsning:**\n$$\\frac{3}{4} \\cdot \\frac{2}{5} = \\frac{3 \\cdot 2}{4 \\cdot 5} = \\frac{6}{20}$$\n\nVi kan forkorte med 2:\n$$\\frac{6}{20} = \\frac{3}{10}$$\n\n**Svar:** $\\frac{3}{10}$"},{"id":"7-1-3-ex-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"7-1-3-ex-1","number":"1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Regn ut og forkort hvis mulig","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot \\frac{3}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{8}$"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{2}{5} \\cdot \\frac{1}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{2}{15}$"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{3}{4} \\cdot \\frac{4}{5}$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{5}$"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{3}{8}$","solution":"$\\frac{1}{4}$"}],"solution":"a) 3/8, b) 2/15, c) 3/5, d) 1/4","hints":["Teller ganger teller, nevner ganger nevner"]}},{"id":"7-1-3-ex-extra-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"7-1-3-ex-extra-1","number":"2","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Regn ut","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot \\frac{1}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{1}{6}$","expressionAnswer":"1/6"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{2}{5} \\cdot \\frac{3}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{6}{20}$ (= $\\frac{3}{10}$)","expressionAnswer":"6/20"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{3}{7} \\cdot \\frac{7}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{21}{21} = 1$","answer":1},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{4}{5} \\cdot \\frac{1}{2}$","solution":"$\\frac{4}{10}$ (= $\\frac{2}{5}$)","expressionAnswer":"4/10"}],"solution":"a) 1/6, b) 6/20, c) 1, d) 4/10","hints":["Gang rett fram: teller · teller og nevner · nevner"]}},{"id":"7-1-3-heltall","type":"text","content":"## Gange brøk med heltall\n\nEt heltall kan skrives som brøk med nevner 1:\n\n$$3 = \\frac{3}{1}$$\n\n**Eksempel:**\n$$\\frac{2}{5} \\cdot 3 = \\frac{2}{5} \\cdot \\frac{3}{1} = \\frac{6}{5} = 1\\frac{1}{5}$$"},{"id":"7-1-3-ex-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"7-1-3-ex-2","number":"3","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Regn ut","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{3}{4} \\cdot 8$","solution":"$6$"},{"label":"b","task":"$5 \\cdot \\frac{2}{3}$","solution":"$3\\frac{1}{3}$"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{5}{6} \\cdot 12$","solution":"$10$"},{"label":"d","task":"$4 \\cdot \\frac{3}{8}$","solution":"$1\\frac{1}{2}$"}],"solution":"a) 6, b) 3 1/3, c) 10, d) 1 1/2","hints":["Skriv heltallet som brøk med nevner 1"]}},{"id":"7-1-3-divisjon","type":"text","content":"## Divisjon med brøk\n\nÅ dele med en brøk er det samme som å gange med den omvendte brøken (bytter teller og nevner)."},{"id":"7-1-3-div-regel","type":"definition","title":"Divisjon med brøk","content":"$$\\frac{a}{b} \\div \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{d}{c}$$\n\n**Å dele med en brøk = å gange med den omvendte**\n\n**Eksempel:**\n$$\\frac{3}{4} \\div \\frac{2}{5} = \\frac{3}{4} \\cdot \\frac{5}{2} = \\frac{15}{8} = 1\\frac{7}{8}$$"},{"id":"7-1-3-example-2","type":"example","title":"Eksempel 2: Dele brøker","problem":"Regn ut: $\\frac{2}{3} \\div \\frac{4}{9}$","solution":"**Løsning:**\nGang med den omvendte brøken:\n$$\\frac{2}{3} \\div \\frac{4}{9} = \\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{9}{4}$$\n\n$$= \\frac{2 \\cdot 9}{3 \\cdot 4} = \\frac{18}{12}$$\n\nForkort med 6:\n$$= \\frac{3}{2} = 1\\frac{1}{2}$$\n\n**Svar:** $1\\frac{1}{2}$"},{"id":"7-1-3-ex-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"7-1-3-ex-3","number":"4","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Regn ut","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{1}{2} \\div \\frac{1}{4}$","solution":"$2$"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{3}{5} \\div \\frac{2}{5}$","solution":"$1\\frac{1}{2}$"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{4}{9} \\div \\frac{2}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{2}{3}$"},{"label":"d","task":"$6 \\div \\frac{3}{4}$","solution":"$8$"}],"solution":"a) 2, b) 1 1/2, c) 2/3, d) 8","hints":["Snu brøken du deler med og gang i stedet"]}},{"id":"7-1-3-ex-extra-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"7-1-3-ex-extra-2","number":"5","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Regn ut divisjonene","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{1}{2} \\div \\frac{1}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot 4 = 2$","answer":2},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{3}{4} \\div \\frac{1}{2}$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{4} \\cdot 2 = \\frac{6}{4} = \\frac{3}{2}$","expressionAnswer":"3/2"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{2}{3} \\div 2$","solution":"$\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{2}{6} = \\frac{1}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"1/3"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{5}{6} \\div \\frac{1}{6}$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{6} \\cdot 6 = 5$","answer":5}],"solution":"a) 2, b) 3/2, c) 1/3, d) 5","hints":["Snu og gang!"]}},{"id":"7-1-3-oppsummering","type":"text","content":"## Oppsummering\n\nI dette kapittelet har du lært:\n\n- **Gange brøker**: Teller ganger teller, nevner ganger nevner: $\\frac{3}{4} \\cdot \\frac{2}{5} = \\frac{6}{20}$.\n- **Gange brøk med heltall**: Gang telleren: $3 \\cdot \\frac{2}{5} = \\frac{6}{5}$.\n- **Dele med brøk**: Snu den bakerste brøken og gang: $\\frac{2}{3} \\div \\frac{4}{9} = \\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{9}{4}$.\n\n### Husk!\n- Ved ganging trenger du IKKE fellesnevner\n- Å dele med $\\frac{1}{2}$ er det samme som å gange med 2\n- Forkort svaret hvis du kan"},{"id":"7-1-3-repetisjon","type":"collapsible","title":"Repetisjonsoppgaver","buttonText":"Vis repetisjonsoppgaver","content":[{"id":"7-1-3-rep-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"7-1-3-rep-ex-1","number":"R1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Regn ut og forkort hvis mulig","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{1}{3} \\cdot \\frac{1}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{1}{12}$","expressionAnswer":"1/12"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{3}{5}$","solution":"$\\frac{6}{15}$ (= $\\frac{2}{5}$)","expressionAnswer":"6/15"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot \\frac{4}{7}$","solution":"$\\frac{4}{14}$ (= $\\frac{2}{7}$)","expressionAnswer":"4/14"},{"label":"d","task":"$5 \\cdot \\frac{1}{10}$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{10}$ (= $\\frac{1}{2}$)","expressionAnswer":"5/10"}],"solution":"a) 1/12, b) 6/15, c) 4/14, d) 5/10","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Teller ganger teller, nevner ganger nevner"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"7-1-3-rep-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"7-1-3-rep-ex-2","number":"R2","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Gang brøk med heltall","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$3 \\cdot \\frac{2}{5}$","solution":"$\\frac{6}{5}$","expressionAnswer":"6/5"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{1}{4} \\cdot 8$","solution":"$\\frac{8}{4} = 2$","answer":2},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot 6$","solution":"$\\frac{12}{3} = 4$","answer":4},{"label":"d","task":"$7 \\cdot \\frac{1}{2}$","solution":"$\\frac{7}{2}$","expressionAnswer":"7/2"}],"solution":"a) 6/5, b) 2, c) 4, d) 7/2","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Heltallet ganges med telleren"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"7-1-3-rep-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"7-1-3-rep-ex-3","number":"R3","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Regn ut","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{1}{3} \\div \\frac{1}{6}$","solution":"$\\frac{1}{3} \\cdot \\frac{6}{1} = \\frac{6}{3} = 2$","answer":2},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{4}{5} \\div \\frac{2}{5}$","solution":"$\\frac{4}{5} \\cdot \\frac{5}{2} = \\frac{20}{10} = 2$","answer":2},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{5}{8} \\div \\frac{1}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{8} \\cdot \\frac{4}{1} = \\frac{20}{8} = \\frac{5}{2}$","expressionAnswer":"5/2"},{"label":"d","task":"$6 \\div \\frac{1}{2}$","solution":"$6 \\cdot 2 = 12$","answer":12}],"solution":"a) 2, b) 2, c) 5/2, d) 12","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Snu den bakerste brøken og gang"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"7-1-3-rep-4","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"7-1-3-rep-ex-4","number":"R4","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Brøk i hverdagen","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Du spiser halvparten av en halv pizza. Hvor stor del av hele pizzaen spiser du?","solution":"$\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot \\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{1}{4}$","expressionAnswer":"1/4"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{3}{4}$ av en sjokolade deles likt mellom 3 venner. Hvor mye får hver?","solution":"$\\frac{3}{4} \\div 3 = \\frac{1}{4}$","expressionAnswer":"1/4"},{"label":"c","task":"En oppskrift trenger $\\frac{2}{3}$ dl sukker per porsjon. Du lager 6 porsjoner. Hvor mange dl sukker trenger du?","solution":"$6 \\cdot \\frac{2}{3} = \\frac{12}{3} = 4$ dl","answer":4},{"label":"d","task":"Du har 2 liter saft og fyller glass som rommer $\\frac{1}{4}$ liter. Hvor mange glass blir det?","solution":"$2 \\div \\frac{1}{4} = 2 \\cdot 4 = 8$ glass","answer":8}],"solution":"a) 1/4, b) 1/4, c) 4 dl, d) 8 glass","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["«Av» betyr gange"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}}]}]}